@dnalec/dsh-message-push README · Service API (for other plugins)：The plugin publishes its service with `ctx.provide('messagePush', …)` on the host plane:

```js
const push = ctx.get('messagePush')
if (push) {
  push.notify({ kind: 'needs-approval', sessionId, title: 'Fix push plugin', body: 'Approve deleting 3 files' })
}
